@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed LC-01 account session and scoped authority identities
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #164E63
top to bottom direction
class Account {
 +actorId : ActorId
 +lifecycle : ActualAccountState
 +version : RevisionId
}
class Invitation
class SessionRecord
class CredentialVerifier <<restricted>>
class ScopedGrant {
 +resource : ScopedResourceId
 +permissionContext : PolicyReference
 +version : RevisionId
}
class AuthorityChangeRecord
Account -- Invitation : intended identity
Account -- SessionRecord : bounded context
Account -- CredentialVerifier : protected verification
Account -- ScopedGrant : explicit subject / resource scope
ScopedGrant -- AuthorityChangeRecord : attributable changes
note bottom of ScopedGrant
 Authentication is not universal authorization.
 Resource owner retains operation/lifecycle checks.
 Role policy and concrete schema remain to reconcile.
end note
@enduml
